    "sm-keep-diff": {
      "id": "sm-keep-diff",
      "type": "structured-table",
      "props": {
        "columns": [
          "Case",
          "What the Reader Sees"
        ],
        "rows": [
          [
            [
              {
                "insert": "ClickHouse error 202, "
              },
              {
                "insert": "TOO_MANY_SIMULTANEOUS_QUERIES",
                "attributes": {
                  "code": true
                }
              }
            ],
            "The query gets up to 3 retries, after 150 ms, 400 ms and 1000 ms. A fourth error 202 fails the query, as any other ClickHouse error does."
          ],
          [
            "A failed ClickHouse query",
            "A failed run list read or run read answers 500. A failed read of the calls of a run gives a tree with no call counts and no pending mark."
          ],
          [
            "Node mode",
            "ClickHouse holds no workflow YAML, so the reader knows the node mode only for a code node and from the provider."
          ],
